    {
      "id": "slot_conflict",
      "finding": "session_prompt is mode=replace. OpenTUI 0.4.5 renders ALL matching contributions, sorted by order then registration order then ID. It is not a single winner or a decorator chain: adding a second composer duplicates composers. Public api.slots provides register only and public plugin statuses omit slot ownership. This fixture conservatively rejects every other enabled external plugin before creating a root or registering; precise coexistence and later plugin changes remain unsupported.",
