      "id": "selection_and_generated_identity",
      "finding": "Native submit samples the current local agent/model/variant and sends the exact existing session ID. Public PromptRef.submit returns void and native prompt request omits messageID, so native creates the user ID. Local onSubmit fires after initiating the promise, before admission/completion is known. Durable custody/replay cannot use that callback as a receipt; this probe reconciles native history after the call.",
