      "id": "draft_and_mode_limit",
      "finding": "The captured ref reads the native store.prompt input/parts. Active normal/shell mode is a separate store.mode; ref.current does not reliably report it, and ref.set does not change it. Native submit can take shell or slash-command branches. The live test is limited to a fresh normal composer, no owner input, no dialog, plain text and no pending request; it does not qualify arbitrary later semantic messages or a universal draft/mode guard.",
